"about_items": [
{
"n": "#86·17",
"text": "The silk trousers in dark taupe are wide-legged and flowy, with a relaxed fit that drapes over your hips and legs. Their subtle sheen catches the light gently, adding refinement without glare."
},
{
"n": "#532·06",
"text": "This brown leather bag from Jacquemus features a clean rectangular shape with contrasting white stitching and a sculpted handle. The minimalist design makes it both elegant and practical."
},
{
"n": "#480·31",
"text": "A sleek silver ring set with two distinct crystal tones—one clear, one warm yellow—adds modern flair without clutter. Its bold band complements the metallic accents in your jewelry palette."
},
{
"n": "#372·21",
"text": "The long camel coat is crafted from soft cashmere with rich velvet detailing at the collar and belt. Its oversized silhouette adds drama while maintaining sophistication for formal settings."
},
{
"n": "#222·17",
"text": "A vibrant fuchsia belt cinches your waist sharply, offering a pop of color that contrasts beautifully with the neutral tones around it. Its rectangular buckle adds architectural interest."
},
{
"n": "#63·00",
"text": "This olive knit top has delicate lace detailing and thin straps that accentuate your shoulders and collarbone. Its cropped length keeps the upper body feeling light and airy."
},
{
"n": "#28·10",
"text": "Burgundy suede boots with a pointed toe and stiletto heel elongate your legs and ground the outfit in rich, autumnal tones. Their stretchy fit ensures all-day comfort."
}
]
